      "billing": {
        "text": "Documentation Index\nFetch the complete documentation index at: https://docs.stability.ai/llms.txt\nUse this file to discover all available pages before exploring further.\nPricing\nCredit pricing for Stability AI API services, including Stable Image, Stable Audio, and 3D models. 1 credit equals $0.01.\nPower your applications with the Stability AI API.\n[card] How does pricing work?\nAPI usage is based on credits. 1 credit = $0.01.\nPricing is subject to change as we improve our models and infrastructure.\n[card] Buying credits (https://platform.stability.ai/dashboard/billing)\nGet started with 25 free credits. Check your credit balance and purchase additional credits on your account page.\nAudio\nStability AI text-to-audio, audio-to-audio, and audio inpaint models.\nStable Image services\nA growing set of APIs for developers to build the best in class image applications.\nGenerate\nUpscale\nEdit\nControl\n3D\nStability AI 3D models for generating 3D assets from a single input image.",
